  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Generate autosdk.docs.json in init command 2026-03-19\n- feat: Standardize docs on single metadata example pattern 2026-03-19\n- feat: add workflow_dispatch trigger to mkdocs workflow template 2026-03-19\n- feat: Fixed duplicated Tags issue #155 2026-03-13\n- fix: recognize net10+ target frameworks for modern C# feature emission 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --base-url CLI option with validation, tests, and docs 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --security-scheme CLI option for specs missing auth (#140) 2026-03-10\n- feat: add Claude Code skill for AI-assisted SDK generation 2026-03-10\n- feat: migrate initialize command from .sln to .slnx format 2026-03-09\n- feat: use default/const values from OpenAPI parameters as C# default parameter values 2026-03-05\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Use string model ID in SpecFromDocsCommand for forward compat 2026-03-19\n- fix: Add permissions to auto-update caller template for reusable workflow 2026-03-19\n- fix: Handle empty env vars in SpecFromDocsCommand 2026-03-19\n- fix: Use is { Length: > 0 } pattern for env var checks in test template 2026-03-19\n- fix: Handle empty API key env vars in integration tests 2026-03-19\n- fix: Resolve remaining CA1031 warnings and make I/O fully async 2026-03-19\n- fix: Resolve CA1849 and null dereference warnings 2026-03-19\n- fix: Improve AnyOf JSON converter discrimination for schemas without discriminator 2026-03-19\n- fix: skip test files with multiple [TestMethod] in Legacy docs mode 2026-03-19\n- fix: Remove redundant pull_request trigger from dotnet.yml template 2026-03-19",
